      "authorship": "originalSynthesis",
      "summary": "Apple released iOS 27.0 developer beta 8 on August 31, 2026 as build 24A5430a, seven days after beta 7. Public Beta 6 followed later the same day on the same platform build.",
      "article": {
        "authorship": "originalSynthesis",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "Apple released iOS 27.0 developer beta 8 on August 31, 2026 as build 24A5430a. The numeric portion advanced by six from beta 7 build 24A5424a after a seven day interval.",
            "citations": [
              {"url": "https://developer.apple.com/news/releases/?id=08312026a", "locator": "iOS 27.0 beta 8, build 24A5430a, released August 31, 2026"},
              {"url": "https://developer.apple.com/news/releases/", "locator": "iOS 27.0 beta 7 build 24A5424a on August 24 and beta 8 build 24A5430a on August 31"}
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "iOS 27 Public Beta 6 followed later on August 31. Version Record keeps the developer and public appearances as separate events while linking both to the same platform-scoped build record.",
            "citations": [
              {"url": "https://www.macrumors.com/2026/08/31/apple-ios-27-public-beta-6/", "locator": "iOS 27 Public Beta 6 released August 31, a few hours after developer beta 8"},
